{"id":"vosem_","lemma":"восемь","pos":"num","rank":645,"glosses":["eight (8)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/34/Ru-%D0%B2%D0%BE%D1%81%D0%B5%D0%BC%D1%8C.ogg/Ru-%D0%B2%D0%BE%D1%81%D0%B5%D0%BC%D1%8C.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Шесть плюс два — восемь.","en":"Six plus two is eight.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1264804","words":[{"g":"six"},{"g":"plus sign"},{"g":"two"},null]},{"text":"Ему восемь лет.","en":"He's eight years old.","words":[{"g":"(to) him","l":"он"},null,{"g":"year","l":"год"}]},{"text":"Три плюс пять будет восемь.","en":"Five plus three is eight.","words":[{"g":"three"},{"g":"plus sign"},{"g":"five"},{"g":"to be","l":"быть"},null]},{"text":"Его сыну восемь лет.","en":"His son is eight years old.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/32476","words":[{"g":"him / his"},{"g":"son","l":"сын"},null,{"g":"year","l":"год"}]},{"text":"Я буду у тебя в восемь.","en":"I will be at your house at eight.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to be","l":"быть"},{"g":"at / by"},{"g":"you","l":"ты"},{"g":"in"},null]}]}